      <p>Keeping up with client meetings and follow-ups is overwhelming. After each call, <strong>Anna struggles to remember all the action items</strong>, leading to delays in next steps.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-badge">
      <span class="step-num">Step 03</span>
